# Node UI design system

Read `packages/node-ui/DESIGN.md` before changing UI code.

- Use the tokens in `src/ui/styles/00-theme.css` and the components in `src/ui/components/ds/`. No hard-coded colours, corner sizes or fractional type sizes.
- Add anything reusable to `components/ds/`, not to one page, and show it on the reference page.
- Text is sentence case. Names keep their capitals: Working Memory, Shared Working Memory, Verifiable Memory, Knowledge Asset, Publisher Conviction.
- Update `DESIGN.md` in the same PR when a rule, token or component changes.
- Layers and status words match nOS, which is their source of truth.

`test/design-tokens.test.ts`, `test/class-has-css.test.ts` and `test/design-docs.test.ts` enforce what can be checked.
